# A market order empties the side and cancels what is left with IOC_REMAINDER.
> new 1 buy gtc 2 @100
< ack 1 buy qty=2 px=100 leaves=2
< level buy px=100 qty=2
> new 2 sell market 5
< ack 2 sell qty=5 px=0 leaves=5
< fill 1 buy qty=2 px=100 contra=2 leaves=0
< fill 2 sell qty=2 px=100 contra=1 leaves=3 aggr
< trade 2 sell qty=2 px=100 contra=1 leaves=3
< level buy px=100 qty=0 removed
< canceled 2 sell qty=3 px=0 reason=IOC_REMAINDER
= live 0
= hash 0xbb25272a3876a1fd
